{"encoding":"verislop.autonomous-critique/0.1","verdict":"REPAIR","counterexamples":[],"corrections":[{"diagnostic_index":0,"artifact":"proposal.lean","explanation":"Replace unresolved proof terms without changing frozen declarations. Prove source_properties by exact VeriSlop.Source.contract_sound VeriSlopAST.SolveSource. Prove complete_behavior with constructor; for the value conjunct use intro input h; simp only [VeriSlopAST.solve, VeriSlopAST.group_rows, VeriSlopAST.bucket_stats]; rfl; for the source conjunct use exact VeriSlop.Source.contract_sound VeriSlopAST.SolveSource. Prove valid_input_inhabited using refine ⟨VeriSlopAST.Input.mk [] 0 0 1 VeriSlopAST.Fill.none, ?_⟩; simp [VeriSlopAST.valid_input]. The existing attempted witnesses all have nonpositive widths and cannot establish the required positive-width predicate."}]}